    "EX527 at 10 uM for 24 h in A375 may produce a histone-mark perturbation profile most similar to epigenetic-modifier donors, especially G9a/GLP inhibitor BIX-01294, because the anchor profile is dominated by H3K27me1K36me3 and related H3K27/K36 methylation marks.",
